<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S4.T3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation Studies on AppWorld.</span> We study how particular design choices of <span id="S4.T3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ACE</span> (iterative refinement, multi-epoch adaptation, and offline warmup) could help high-quality context adaptation. </figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
